<resources>
    <!-- The plain wallpaper's one colour (TallyWallpaper), the same in light and dark theme:
         Stone, tone 40 of the palette's neutral variant (#635E57 for Sodium), so it takes the
         colour preset's hue as every Tally neutral does. White and the dark theme's ink stay at
         5:1 or better on it. A fixed colour goes here as a plain #RRGGBB value. No values-night
         variant: it does not change with dark theme. -->
    <color name="tally_wallpaper_plain">@android:color/system_neutral2_600</color>
</resources>
